{"seq":2,"slug":"health-assessment","title":"大学护理学 — 健康评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-foundations/health-assessment","wordCount":2087,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学护理学-健康评估\">大学护理学 — 健康评估</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>健康评估是护理实践的第一步也是最关键的一步——没有准确的评估，就不可能制定正确的护理计划。健康评估整合了体格检查技术、健康史采集、实验室数据解读和护理判断能力，是连接医学知识与护理实践的桥梁。与医学评估侧重疾病诊断不同，护理健康评估更关注患者的功能状态、自理能力、健康行为和护理需求。一个训练有素的护士能够通过系统的评估迅速识别潜在的健康问题，为早期干预争取宝贵时间。</p>\n<p>核心评估技能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>健康史采集</strong>：系统化的问诊技术和沟通技巧</li>\n<li><strong>体格检查四大手法</strong>：视诊、触诊、叩诊、听诊</li>\n<li><strong>系统评估</strong>：心血管、呼吸、腹部、神经等各系统的检查方法</li>\n<li><strong>功能评估</strong>：日常生活活动能力（ADL）、认知功能、疼痛评估</li>\n<li><strong>实验室检查解读</strong>：常见检验指标的临床意义</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-健康史采集\">一、健康史采集</h3><p>健康史是患者信息的第一手来源，高质量的问诊可以获得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\% \\sim 80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 的诊断线索。系统的健康史包括以下组成部分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成部分</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>护理关注重点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一般资料</td>\n<td>姓名、年龄、性别、职业</td>\n<td>与健康风险的关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主诉</td>\n<td>就诊的主要原因和持续时间</td>\n<td>问题的优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现病史</td>\n<td>症状的起始、发展、伴随情况</td>\n<td>PQRST 评估法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>既往史</td>\n<td>过去的疾病、手术、过敏史</td>\n<td>潜在风险和禁忌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>家族史</td>\n<td>直系亲属的健康状况</td>\n<td>遗传倾向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个人史</td>\n<td>生活习惯、饮食、运动、吸烟饮酒</td>\n<td>可改变的健康行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>心理社会史</td>\n<td>情绪状态、支持系统、经济状况</td>\n<td>护理需求的全面性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>症状评估的 PQRST 框架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>P（Provocation/Palliation）</strong>：诱发和缓解因素</li>\n<li><strong>Q（Quality）</strong>：性质——钝痛、锐痛、压迫感、烧灼感</li>\n<li><strong>R（Region/Radiation）</strong>：部位和放射方向</li>\n<li><strong>S（Severity）</strong>：严重程度，使用数字评定量表（NRS，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\sim 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 分）</li>\n<li><strong>T（Timing）</strong>：起始时间、持续时间、发作频率</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-体格检查的基本技术\">二、体格检查的基本技术</h3><p><strong>视诊</strong>：系统观察患者的一般状态、营养状况、步态、皮肤颜色、呼吸模式等。视诊贯穿评估全过程，是最基本也最容易被忽视的检查手段。</p>\n<p><strong>触诊</strong>：用手的不同部位感知体表温度（手背）、振颤（掌面）、质地和弹性（指腹）、深部器官（双手深触诊）。触诊时应注意：先浅后深、先无痛区后可疑区、温暖双手、观察面部表情。</p>\n<p><strong>叩诊</strong>：通过叩击体表产生的声音判断深部组织的物理状态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>叩诊音</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>见于</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>清音</td>\n<td>响亮、低调、持续时间长</td>\n<td>正常肺组织</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过清音</td>\n<td>比清音更响</td>\n<td>肺气肿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鼓音</td>\n<td>如击鼓</td>\n<td>胃泡区、气胸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浊音</td>\n<td>音调较高、持续短</td>\n<td>肝脏、心脏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实音</td>\n<td>高调、持续极短</td>\n<td>大量胸腔积液</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>听诊</strong>：使用听诊器评估心音、呼吸音、肠鸣音和血管杂音。听诊器的膜面适合高频声音（如心脏杂音），钟面适合低频声音（如二尖瓣狭窄杂音）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-重点系统评估\">三、重点系统评估</h3><p><strong>心血管系统评估</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>心前区视诊：心尖搏动位置（正常在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 肋间锁骨中线内侧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5 \\sim 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> cm）</li>\n<li>心脏听诊：按二尖瓣区→肺动脉瓣区→主动脉瓣区→主动脉瓣第二听诊区→三尖瓣区的顺序</li>\n<li>正常心音：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（二尖瓣和三尖瓣关闭音，低调）和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（主动脉瓣和肺动脉瓣关闭音，高调）</li>\n<li>外周血管：桡动脉脉搏评估频率、节律、强度；足背动脉评估下肢血供</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>呼吸系统评估</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>呼吸频率和深度：正常成人 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12 \\sim 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分</li>\n<li>呼吸音听诊：正常支气管呼吸音、肺泡呼吸音；异常的干啰音、湿啰音、哮鸣音</li>\n<li>血氧饱和度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：正常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>腹部评估</strong>（特殊顺序：视诊→听诊→叩诊→触诊）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>先听诊后触诊，避免触诊改变肠鸣音频率</li>\n<li>正常肠鸣音 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\sim 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分</li>\n<li>肠鸣音消失（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟无声）提示肠麻痹；肠鸣音亢进提示机械性肠梗阻或腹泻</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>神经系统快速评估</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>意识水平：Glasgow 昏迷量表（GCS）——睁眼反应（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\sim 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 分）+ 言语反应（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\sim 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 分）+ 运动反应（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\sim 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 分），总分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\sim 15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分</li>\n<li>瞳孔：大小（正常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\sim 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> mm）、对光反射、双侧对称性</li>\n<li>肌力分级：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\sim 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 级（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> 无肌肉收缩，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> 正常）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四-功能评估工具\">四、功能评估工具</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[功能评估] --&gt; B[日常生活活动]&#10;    A --&gt; C[认知功能]&#10;    A --&gt; D[疼痛评估]&#10;    A --&gt; E[营养状况]&#10;    A --&gt; F[跌倒风险]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Barthel 指数]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[MMSE 简易精神状态检查]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[NRS 数字评定量表]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[NRS-2002 营养风险筛查]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[Morse 跌倒评估量表]\">graph TD\n    A[功能评估] --&gt; B[日常生活活动]\n    A --&gt; C[认知功能]\n    A --&gt; D[疼痛评估]\n    A --&gt; E[营养状况]\n    A --&gt; F[跌倒风险]\n    B --&gt; B1[Barthel 指数]\n    C --&gt; C1[MMSE 简易精神状态检查]\n    D --&gt; D1[NRS 数字评定量表]\n    E --&gt; E1[NRS-2002 营养风险筛查]\n    F --&gt; F1[Morse 跌倒评估量表]</pre><p><strong>Barthel 指数</strong>：评估日常生活活动（ADL）能力的经典量表，包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 项活动（进食、洗澡、穿衣、如厕、控制大小便、转移、行走、上下楼梯），总分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 分。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 分为基本自理，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 分为重度依赖。</p>\n<p><strong>MMSE（简易精神状态检查）</strong>：快速认知功能筛查工具，包含定向力、记忆力、注意力和计算、回忆、语言能力五个维度，总分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 分。文盲 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 17</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17</span></span></span></span></span> 分、小学 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分、中学及以上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> 分提示认知功能障碍。</p>\n<p><strong>疼痛评估</strong>：第五生命体征。除 NRS（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\sim 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>）外，还有面部表情评估量表（适用于儿童和沟通困难者）、FLACC 量表（适用于无法自我报告的患者）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-常见实验室检查的护理解读\">五、常见实验室检查的护理解读</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项目</th>\n<th>正常参考值</th>\n<th>临床意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>白细胞计数（WBC）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(4 \\sim 10) \\times 10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/L</td>\n<td>升高提示感染、降低提示免疫抑制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>血红蛋白（Hb）</td>\n<td>男 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>160</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120 \\sim 160</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">160</span></span></span></span></span> g/L，女 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>110</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">110 \\sim 150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">110</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> g/L</td>\n<td>降低提示贫血</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空腹血糖</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.9</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>6.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.9 \\sim 6.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.1</span></span></span></span></span> mmol/L</td>\n<td>升高提示糖尿病</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>血钾</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.5</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>5.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.5 \\sim 5.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.5</span></span></span></span></span> mmol/L</td>\n<td>异常可致心律失常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肌酐（Cr）</td>\n<td>男 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>54</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>106</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">54 \\sim 106</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">54</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">106</span></span></span></span></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>mol/L</td>\n<td>升高提示肾功能损害</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INR</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8 \\sim 1.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span></span></span></span></span>（抗凝治疗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>3.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.0 \\sim 3.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.0</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>监测华法林抗凝效果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>护士在解读实验室结果时，重点关注的是异常值对护理计划的影响——例如低血钾患者需要心电监护，高INR患者需要出血预防措施。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>使用 PQRST 框架，对一位主诉&quot;胸痛 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 小时&quot;的患者进行系统的症状评估。写出你会提出的具体问题。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75</span></span></span></span></span> 岁住院患者的 GCS 评分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_3V_4M_5 = 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 分。解读每项得分的含义，并描述患者的意识状态。与入院时 GCS <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分相比，这一变化意味着什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么腹部评估中听诊必须在触诊之前进行。如果顺序颠倒，可能导致什么评估错误？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某患者 Barthel 指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span></span></span></span></span> 分，MMSE <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 分（小学文化程度）。综合分析其功能状态和认知能力，制定相应的护理重点。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一位服用华法林的患者 INR 升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.5</span></span></span></span></span>，同时出现皮肤瘀斑。描述护士应采取的评估步骤和优先护理措施。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《健康评估》</strong>（孙玉梅主编）：国内护理本科核心教材</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Bates&#39; Guide to Physical Examination and History Taking&quot;</strong>：全球最经典的体格检查教材</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Weber &amp; Kelley&#39;s Health Assessment in Nursing&quot;</strong>：护理视角的健康评估教材</li>\n<li><strong>常用评估量表汇编</strong>：Barthel、GCS、MMSE、NRS 等标准化工具</li>\n<li><strong>UpToDate 临床决策支持</strong>：实验室检查结果的临床解读</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>健康评估是护理专业能力的核心体现。完整的评估包括健康史采集、系统化体格检查、功能评估和实验室数据解读。视触叩听四大手法是体格检查的基本功，各系统评估有其特定的检查要点和异常发现的临床意义。标准化评估工具（Barthel 指数、GCS、MMSE 等）使评估结果可量化、可比较。护士进行健康评估时，始终关注的是评估结果对护理决策的指导意义——发现问题、确定优先级、制定护理计划。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学护理学 — 健康评估","id":"大学护理学-健康评估"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、健康史采集","id":"一-健康史采集"},{"level":3,"text":"二、体格检查的基本技术","id":"二-体格检查的基本技术"},{"level":3,"text":"三、重点系统评估","id":"三-重点系统评估"},{"level":3,"text":"四、功能评估工具","id":"四-功能评估工具"},{"level":3,"text":"五、常见实验室检查的护理解读","id":"五-常见实验室检查的护理解读"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学护理学 — 护理理论与护理模式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-foundations/nursing-theory"},"next":{"title":"大学护理学 — 基础护理技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/nursing/nursing-foundations/basic-nursing-skills"}}